7","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 88, lines 23-47"}]},{"heading":"How the case got here","paragraphs":["The Supreme Court heard oral argument in this case on November 12, 2019."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 11-25","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 11-25"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 78, lines 41-9","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 78, lines 41-9"}]},{"heading":"What each side wants","paragraphs":["The government wants the court to uphold the program termination.","Opponents want the court to reverse the termination order."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 44, lines 35-39","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 44, lines 35-39"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 27-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 27-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 67, lines 29-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 67, lines 29-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 70, lines 23-35","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 70, lines 23-35"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 88, lines 23-47","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 88, lines 23-47"}]},{"heading":"What each side says","paragraphs":["The government argues the termination decision is unreviewable.","Opponents argue the illegality claim makes the decision reviewable."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 44, lines 35-39","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 44, lines 35-39"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 5, lines 27-21","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 5, lines 27-21"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 67, lines 29-15","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 67, lines 29-15"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 70, lines 23-35","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 70, lines 23-35"},{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 88, lines 23-47","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_arguments/argument_transcripts/2019/18-587_1bn2.pdf","page_label":"file page 88, lines 23-47"}]},{"heading":"What the justices asked","paragraphs":["Justice Ginsburg asked if the memo stated DACA was illegal.","Justice Kagan asked if the original policy is reviewable but the rescission is not."],"sources":[{"evidence_type":"Transcript","label":"Official Supreme Court Transcript — file page 10, lines 31-41","official_url":"https://www.supremecourt.gov/oral_argum